<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><img alt="VIP Banner" src="" style="max-width: 1640.6499999999999px" title="VIP Banner" /><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},<br />
<br />
Sorry we missed you earlier - as you are a&nbsp;valued {{{Recipient.Frequent_Flyer_Tier__c}}} member, our team is dedicated to overseeing your travel experiences with Qantas and we were calling you with an important update regarding your upcoming journey.</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="background:white"><span style="color:black">Due to unscheduled maintenance requirements on some of our A380 aircraft, we have had to make some changes to our schedules.&nbsp;</span></span><span style="background:white"><span style="color:black">As a result, {{{Case.Flight_Number_With_Code__c}}}&nbsp;from {{{Case.Departure_City__c}}}&nbsp;to&nbsp;{{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}}&nbsp;on {{{Case.TECH_Departure_Date__c}}} will now be operated by a Boeing 787 Dreamliner aircraft, which means that our First Class cabin will no longer be available. </span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">We recognise that your travel plans are important - so to ensure you can still get to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}}&nbsp;as you originally planned, we have rebooked you into Business Class on the same flight and processed a refund of&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:#e74c3c">AUDXXXX or XXXXX points&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">per person.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:red">Unfortunately, your return journey has also been impacted - so we have rebooked this flight as well, processing a refund of (AUDXXXX) (123456 points) per person for that sector.</span></span></span></span><br style="font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial" />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="background:white"><span style="color:black">If this change is not suitable, please feel free to contact the VIP Service Team on the dedicated number below and we will explore alternative options for you.</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">We look forward to welcoming you at the <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/qantas-experience/at-the-airport/airport-lounges/all-qantas-airport-lounges/airport-lounge-locations.html/syd/International%20First%20Lounge.html" style="color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline">Sydney International First Lounge</a></span></span></span> <span style="background:white"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/qantas-experience/at-the-airport/airport-lounges/all-qantas-airport-lounges/airport-lounge-locations.html/mel/International%20First%20Lounge" style="color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline">Melbourne International First Lounge</a> <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/qantas-experience/at-the-airport/airport-lounges/all-qantas-airport-lounges/los-angeles-international-first-lounge.html" style="color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline">Los Angeles International First Lounge</a>&nbsp;and onboard soon.</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:11.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Kind regards,</span><br style="font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial" />
<br style="font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial" />
{{{Sender.FirstName}}}<br />
